+    /* Diagnostic bridge for the WebAuthenticationCoreManager implementation
+     * under construction. Once its classes.idl carries the registration this
+     * disappears; keeping the mapping here for the first run lets the factory
+     * tell us which method Office actually calls without mutating the prefix. */
